rious sizes, in black, are scattered across the wall, and a large ‘4’ on the wall inside is also visible. The surroundings are reflected in the glass, making the image seem a little unsettling. The image is in black and white. " height="2448" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aa007f5123dc.jpg" width="2684"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 13:04:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>位于柏林的Romeo und Romeo的彩虹蛋糕</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9fe505f1218</link><description>&lt;p&gt;位于柏林的Romeo und Romeo的彩虹蛋糕&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="the rainbow cake at Romeo und Romeo in Berlin" height="1768" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/yuko/6a9fe505f1218.png" width="1769"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://yuko.some.pics"&gt;@yuko&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 10:35:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>模拟通勤散步</title><link>https://some.pics/6a9fbb0c67400</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🚶🏻模拟通勤&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An forest path winding through dense green trees and foliage, with a dirt trail scattered with fallen leaves and sunlight filtering through the canopy. In the lower-right corner are blue decorative elements—a walking-person icon in a blue circle and a large turquoise outline of a winding path—along with a pale blue banner at the bottom edge that reads “edegem # 2,4 km.”" height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6a9fbb0c67400.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 07:36:51 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>